    - target: {fileID: 1253161411824071964, guid: 50fe8fa53408c3d45b668daabee7b142, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\u2022 This station provides one of the most popular robot types in
        the industrial space which is the 6-axis Robot arm. \r\n\r\n\u2022 It is
        equipped with a 6-axis articulated arm by robot controller, and multifunction
        gripper.\r\n\r\n\u2022 The 6-axis allow a robot to move in the x,y, and z
        planes, as well as position itself using roll, pitch, and yaw movements.
        This functionality is suitable for complex movements that simulate a human
        arm.\r\n\r\n\u2022 This station demonstrates how to use robot arm in the
        handling operation in industrial process.\r\n\r\n\u2022 The workpieces are
        transferred by the robot from a running process to another process."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
